+
+Scoring-request schema 1.1 separates logical `task_id` and `task_family_id`
+labels from the exact `task_revision_fingerprint` used as the estimator item
+axis. One logical task may have multiple revisions, but one revision may map to
+only one logical task and family. The digest prevents silent pooling; it does not
+establish comparability. Cross-revision linking requires governed anchors,
+recovery, drift, and invariance/DIF evidence. See
+[`scoring_task_revision_identity.md`](scoring_task_revision_identity.md).
 
